"<h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2>\n<p>By creating an account, accessing our dashboard, or using the <strong>SaaS Base</strong> deployment scripts and software services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service (\"Terms\"). If you do not agree to these Terms, please do not use our services.</p>\n<h2>2. Description of Service</h2>\n<p>SaaS Base provides a management platform, orchestration tooling, and user interface designed to help developers and companies deploy, configure, and operate open-source Supabase backends and related services on their own virtual private servers (VPS) or cloud infrastructure.</p>\n<h2>3. Account Registration &#x26; Security</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>You must provide accurate, current, and complete registration information.</li>\n<li>You are responsible for safeguarding your account credentials, API keys, and SSH access keys.</li>\n<li>You must promptly notify SaaS Base if you discover or suspect any unauthorized access to your account.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>4. Infrastructure &#x26; Server Responsibility</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Your Cloud Hosting Costs:</strong> You acknowledge that server costs (VPS, storage volumes, bandwidth, domains) incurred with third-party providers (such as Hetzner, Vultr, AWS, or DigitalOcean) are your sole responsibility.</li>\n<li><strong>Server Maintenance &#x26; Backups:</strong> While SaaS Base provides automated backup scheduling and health monitoring utilities, you are ultimately responsible for maintaining appropriate disaster recovery procedures and verifying backup integrity.</li>\n<li><strong>Root Access &#x26; Custom Modifications:</strong> You retain full root access to your servers. Any manual changes or conflicting software installed outside the SaaS Base control plane that causes system failure are your responsibility.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>5. Acceptable Use Policy</h2>\n<p>You agree not to use SaaS Base or your deployed instances to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Violate any applicable local, national, or international laws or regulations.</li>\n<li>Distribute malware, spyware, ransomware, or engage in unauthorized network attacks (such as DDoS or port scanning).</li>\n<li>Host, distribute, or transmit fraudulent, deceptive, or abusive material.</li>\n<li>Attempt to reverse engineer, disrupt, or compromise the integrity of the SaaS Base management platform.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SaaS Base Software:</strong> All proprietary UI components, management dashboards, branding, documentation, and tooling provided by SaaS Base remain the exclusive intellectual property of SaaS Base.</li>\n<li><strong>Open-Source Components:</strong> Software components derived from the Supabase ecosystem, PostgreSQL, Docker, and other open-source projects are licensed under their respective open-source licenses (e.g., Apache 2.0, MIT, PostgreSQL license).</li>\n<li><strong>Your Data &#x26; Code:</strong> You own all intellectual property rights in and to your databases, schemas, custom functions, and application code.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7. Disclaimers of Warranties</h2>\n<p>SaaS Base and all automated deployment templates are provided on an <strong>\"AS IS\"</strong> and <strong>\"AS AVAILABLE\"</strong> basis without warranties of any kind, either express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, uptime guarantees, or non-infringement. We do not warrant that the service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or entirely secure from external threats.</p>\n<h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>\n<p>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, in no event shall SaaS Base, its officers, employees, or affiliates be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, including loss of profits, data, goodwill, or server downtime, arising from or related to your use of or inability to use the service.</p>\n<h2>9. Modifications to Terms</h2>\n<p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. When changes are made, we will update the \"Last Updated\" date at the top of this page. Your continued use of the service following the posting of updated Terms constitutes your acceptance of the revisions.</p>\n<h2>10. Governing Law &#x26; Contact</h2>\n<p>These Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with applicable laws without regard to conflict of law principles.</p>\n<p>If you have questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Email:</strong> legal@saasbase.dev</li>\n<li><strong>Discord:</strong> https://discord.com</li>\n<li><strong>Website:</strong> https://saasbase.dev</li>\n</ul>"